WEBVTT

00:00:05.920 --> 00:00:08.920
Wow, it's so big!

00:00:09.290 --> 00:00:11.460
It's true-if you're in Nara,
you have to see the Great Buddha.

00:00:11.630 --> 00:00:12.580
Right, Maki?

00:00:14.500 --> 00:00:15.250
Huh?

00:00:15.790 --> 00:00:18.630
I'm... I'm almost there...

00:00:19.420 --> 00:00:22.210
Urushi... Give me a hand...

00:00:22.460 --> 00:00:24.000
Are you okay?

00:00:25.080 --> 00:00:26.130
Here we go!
Ow ow ow ow ow!<b></b>

00:00:27.290 --> 00:00:30.540
Yay! Good luck achieved!

00:00:32.290 --> 00:00:37.630
When I got stuck in that pillar,
I was afraid my class trip would be over on the first day.

00:00:37.790 --> 00:00:39.290
Don't be so dramatic.

00:00:39.750 --> 00:00:42.290
No, really. I was in serious trouble.

00:00:42.580 --> 00:00:44.920
My breasts just wouldn't fit through.

00:00:45.790 --> 00:00:47.790
What the-! I wish I could say that!

00:00:48.170 --> 00:00:49.830
Now it's your turn, Urushi!

00:00:50.630 --> 00:00:55.420
No, but-! If I go right after you, and get through without
any problems, that'll be kind of embarrassing.

00:00:55.420 --> 00:00:59.580
How can you say that?
You don't come on a school trip every day!

00:00:59.790 --> 00:01:01.130
Go on, go for it!

00:01:01.130 --> 00:01:02.670
J-just a-! No! Ugh!

00:01:01.880 --> 00:01:05.960
Come on, Urushi! You know you want to!

00:01:02.880 --> 00:01:05.790
Looks like they're having some fun over there!

00:01:05.790 --> 00:01:07.170
Yeah, it does!

00:01:07.790 --> 00:01:09.290
Sigh.

00:01:09.880 --> 00:01:12.710
Uh, why is Urushi making that face?

00:01:12.710 --> 00:01:14.040
No idea.

00:01:14.040 --> 00:01:16.580
There, there. This is a good thing!

00:01:16.580 --> 00:01:18.830
You got your good luck without any trouble!

00:01:19.420 --> 00:01:20.670
I'm not so sure.

00:01:22.330 --> 00:01:23.790
Don't you make that face!

00:01:24.040 --> 00:01:27.830
We're in the middle of your super fun,
super awesome school trip! You have to smile!

00:01:28.040 --> 00:01:29.750
Wh-what are you doing?

00:01:32.460 --> 00:01:35.670
This is the last school trip of our student careers, after all.

00:01:37.460 --> 00:01:40.000
So let's make it the best one ever!

00:01:44.080 --> 00:01:44.920
Yeah!

00:01:47.130 --> 00:01:50.630
Now, let's take one step forward

00:01:50.630 --> 00:01:54.040
Let me feel your heartbeat

00:01:54.420 --> 00:01:57.290
Tactics require a poker face

00:01:57.290 --> 00:02:02.380
Because I don't want my opponent to realize

00:02:02.630 --> 00:02:05.830
For distance, a few centimeters

00:02:05.830 --> 00:02:08.960
Take the long way

00:02:09.460 --> 00:02:12.500
Aiming for a smile

00:02:12.500 --> 00:02:15.880
A secret strategy

00:02:16.130 --> 00:02:19.040
An airtight defense

00:02:19.380 --> 00:02:22.250
Just a little more

00:02:23.000 --> 00:02:28.710
I'll meet you halfway, so look the other way

00:02:28.710 --> 00:02:32.710
I get scared of being hurt

00:02:32.710 --> 00:02:35.920
There are nights like that

00:02:36.080 --> 00:02:39.420
A chance that comes from crossed signals

00:02:39.420 --> 00:02:43.710
I won't let it escape me. I'll turn the tables

00:02:46.040 --> 00:02:49.420
Now, let's take one step forward

00:02:49.420 --> 00:02:52.580
Write your own story

00:02:53.210 --> 00:02:59.170
The opening sentence always starts with "actually," "I always"

00:02:59.580 --> 00:03:02.710
The twist is in progressive tense

00:03:02.710 --> 00:03:06.040
Let me feel your heartbeat

00:03:06.670 --> 00:03:09.540
Tactics require a poker face

00:03:09.540 --> 00:03:14.790
Because I don't want my opponent to realize

00:03:20.630 --> 00:03:25.580
<b>Game 11: I Want to Get Stronger, Senpai</b>

00:03:21.500 --> 00:03:23.920
Ayumu! Walk home with us!

00:03:24.170 --> 00:03:26.380
Sorry, I'm on my way to club.

00:03:26.790 --> 00:03:29.830
What, really? It's not canceled with the president gone?

00:03:30.040 --> 00:03:31.170
Kakuryu-san!

00:03:32.000 --> 00:03:34.080
We're having our club meeting as usual.

00:03:34.330 --> 00:03:36.130
Rin? What are you doing here?

00:03:36.130 --> 00:03:38.830
No one was in the club room, so I came to get you.

00:03:40.460 --> 00:03:41.580
Me?

00:03:43.830 --> 00:03:47.330
Oh yeah, you are in the shogi club, aren't you?

00:03:48.330 --> 00:03:50.290
Hey! Wait a minute!

00:03:50.290 --> 00:03:52.380
Try to ditch if you want, but you won't get away with it!

00:03:52.500 --> 00:03:55.830
You didn't even remember that I was in the shogi club!

00:03:55.830 --> 00:03:57.830
That was one thing. This is another.

00:03:58.960 --> 00:03:59.960
Ayumu-kun.

00:04:00.710 --> 00:04:03.790
