I'm just going to go home.

00:04:04.080 --> 00:04:05.250
Yeah, sorry.

00:04:05.250 --> 00:04:06.170
It's okay.

00:04:07.380 --> 00:04:11.210
I think I heard the third-years will be
in Nara for the first day of their trip.

00:04:11.460 --> 00:04:12.080
Yeah.

00:04:12.960 --> 00:04:15.830
I hope Senpai and her friends are having a good time.

00:04:17.000 --> 00:04:17.920
Yeah, me too.

00:04:20.130 --> 00:04:22.880
Aaahh, help me!

00:04:23.040 --> 00:04:25.000
Please, stay away from me!

00:04:25.000 --> 00:04:26.380
I've had enough!

00:04:28.460 --> 00:04:30.130
Urushi sure is popular.

00:04:30.130 --> 00:04:31.540
She sure is!

00:04:36.080 --> 00:04:38.920
Oh man. That was the worst.

00:04:43.540 --> 00:04:46.250
<b>Prayer for</b>

00:04:43.540 --> 00:04:46.250
<b>safe travels</b>

00:04:44.330 --> 00:04:45.750
Whew...

00:04:46.630 --> 00:04:49.500
Urushi! Whatcha doin'?

00:04:46.880 --> 00:04:49.080
Okay, smile bigger!

00:04:49.080 --> 00:04:50.080
So cute!

00:04:50.080 --> 00:04:51.080
Good boy!

00:04:50.250 --> 00:04:51.630
Oh, nothing!

00:04:52.790 --> 00:04:58.080
As I have told you numerous times! You need to stop
trying to block in these situations. That's a bad habit.

00:04:58.670 --> 00:04:59.500
Right.

00:05:02.750 --> 00:05:04.880
Maybe we should call it a day.

00:05:09.750 --> 00:05:12.000
Kakuryu-san seems to be at his limit.

00:05:12.460 --> 00:05:15.460
No, forget about Takeru. He'll be fine.

00:05:16.000 --> 00:05:18.290
Would you mind playing with me a little longer?

00:05:19.580 --> 00:05:22.250
Alright. I'll be here as long as you need me.

00:05:27.580 --> 00:05:29.630
Want to pick up some pork buns on the way home?

00:05:30.670 --> 00:05:32.330
Yes, please.

00:05:32.960 --> 00:05:34.920
<b>Women's Bath</b>

00:05:36.960 --> 00:05:39.250
This feels amazing.

00:05:41.920 --> 00:05:43.540
Urushi? What's wrong?

00:05:45.750 --> 00:05:47.540
You know, Urushi.

00:05:47.920 --> 00:05:50.920
There is nothing good about having them big.

00:05:51.290 --> 00:05:56.460
They're heavy, they give you back pain, they make it hard
to see where you're walking, they get stuck in pillars...

00:05:56.460 --> 00:05:57.830
It's just terrible.

00:05:58.790 --> 00:06:00.630
That all sounds like bragging.

00:06:00.830 --> 00:06:03.830
Ohh, are you worried about your chest size?

00:06:03.830 --> 00:06:07.830
Cheer up, Urushi! I agree. I think moderate-size is best.

00:06:08.380 --> 00:06:10.750
Yeah, mine aren't even moderate.

00:06:10.960 --> 00:06:13.000
Oh no! I made it worse!

00:06:13.670 --> 00:06:15.920
Oh, speaking of breasts...

00:06:15.920 --> 00:06:18.580
In Aichi, they have that Breast Temple.

00:06:18.580 --> 00:06:23.420
Oh, the Mama Kannon Temple!
The one that will give you good luck in chest growth.

00:06:24.830 --> 00:06:26.040
Good luck...

00:06:27.330 --> 00:06:29.960
Don't Maki's breasts look like they could give good luck?

00:06:31.250 --> 00:06:33.290
Ooh, I think you're right!

00:06:33.420 --> 00:06:36.960
Get her to let you touch them, Urushi! It'll be good luck!

00:06:37.500 --> 00:06:39.130
No, no, that's just...

00:06:39.580 --> 00:06:40.750
Right?

00:06:41.540 --> 00:06:42.580
Okay.

00:06:45.880 --> 00:06:48.880
Try... try not to hurt me.

00:06:49.920 --> 00:06:51.460
Don't act that way!

00:06:51.460 --> 00:06:52.750
You're making it weird!

00:06:55.130 --> 00:06:57.790
She was fully intending to actually do it.

00:06:59.210 --> 00:07:00.750
But anyway...

00:07:02.000 --> 00:07:07.210
I heard that your breasts will grow bigger if you get
someone who makes your heart race to touch them.

00:07:08.960 --> 00:07:10.750
Someone who makes my heart race... ?

00:07:18.960 --> 00:07:21.920
Ah, I'm in heaven.

00:07:24.170 --> 00:07:25.000
Tanaka-san?

00:07:28.420 --> 00:07:29.500
Tanaka-san.

00:07:31.420 --> 00:07:32.080
What?

00:07:32.080 --> 00:07:34.500
What's the matter? You were staring into space.

00:07:35.080 --> 00:07:39.250
I was thinking about our game. I just can't think of
a single comeback move I could have used there.

00:07:39.250 --> 00:07:41.290
Shogi again?

00:07:42.250 --> 00:07:44.170
You're really passionate about this.

00:07:44.630 --> 00:07:47.380
How can you be so lazy?

00:07:47.580 --> 00:07:49.290
Would you please get your act together?

00:07:50.170 --> 00:07:53.630
I didn't think you'd destroy me that badly.

00:07:53.960 --> 00:07:56.040
And I won't hold back tomorrow, either!

00:07:56.960 --> 00:07:58.750
Don't you groan at me!

00:07:58.750 --> 00:08:00.330
I have library duty tomorrow, so I can't go.

00:08:00.330 --> 00:08:02.130
Keep acting like that and you'll never...

00:08:00.920 --> 00:08:04.580
Come to think of it, how are things
with you and Tanaka-kun?

00:08:04.830 --> 00:08:07.040
Wh-why are you asking me that?

00:08:07.380 --> 00:08:10.540
Have you stayed in touch while you were on this trip?

00:08:10.540 --> 00:08:12.460
No, we haven't...

00:08:12.460 --> 00:08:14.460
What!? Why not?

00:08:14.460 --> 00:08:17.330
Well, he hasn't tried to contact me at all, so...

00:08:18.040 --> 00:08:20.540
Okay, well, have you gone on any dates with him?

00:08:20.540 --> 00:08:22.330
Yeah, have you held hands or anything?

00:08:22.630 --> 00:08:24.420
No, um...

00:08:25.290 --> 00:08:28.830
We... we have held hands before... I think.

00:08:28.830 --> 00:08:30.040
Oh!

00:08:30.500 --> 00:08:33.790
And we took pictures together, I guess.

00:08:33.790 --> 00:08:34.790
Oh!

00:08:36.130 --> 00:08:40.250
And... before the school trip...
he gave me a good luck charm.

00:08:41.210 --> 00:08:42.330
A good luck charm?

00:08:42.330 --> 00:08:44.080
What!? You never told me about that!

00:08:44.460 --> 00:08:46.380
It's not like I need to report it...

00:08:46.580 --> 00:08:48.210
When did he give it to you?

00:08:50.830 --> 00:08:54.420
L-last night... Ayumu came to my house. That's when.

00:08:54.670 --> 00:08:55.420
At night!

00:08:55.420 --> 00:08:56.670
He went to your house!

00:08:56.670 --> 00:08:58.000
No, it wasn't...

00:08:58.500 --> 00:09:01.000
