00:09:01.000 --> 00:09:02.420
Aw!

00:09:03.000 --> 00:09:06.170
That settles it! Tomorrow let's all go on
a love fulfillment prayer tour!

00:09:06.170 --> 00:09:07.540
What settles what!?

00:09:07.880 --> 00:09:09.460
Great idea!

00:09:40.210 --> 00:09:41.420
Who's it from?

00:09:41.420 --> 00:09:42.420
Oh...

00:09:43.710 --> 00:09:44.750
My boyfriend.

00:09:45.130 --> 00:09:45.630
Boyfriend!?

00:09:46.540 --> 00:09:48.380
You have a boyfriend, Hinano?

00:09:49.380 --> 00:09:51.500
He's a friend of my brother's.

00:09:51.500 --> 00:09:53.460
What!? An older man!?

00:09:53.460 --> 00:09:54.130
Yes!

00:09:54.330 --> 00:09:56.080
Details! Details!

00:09:56.880 --> 00:10:01.040
Then I think you could work something out
if you used an edge attack from your pawn on 14.

00:10:01.500 --> 00:10:02.540
I see...

00:10:03.420 --> 00:10:05.540
Yes. That will work.

00:10:05.540 --> 00:10:06.750
I'm glad.

00:10:07.420 --> 00:10:09.040
Sorry to call you so late.

00:10:09.250 --> 00:10:12.080
I just couldn't figure anything out on my own.

00:10:12.420 --> 00:10:16.540
It's alright. I wouldn't have thought of
it before talking to you, either.

00:10:17.420 --> 00:10:20.500
By the way, have you heard anything
from Ms. President?

00:10:21.580 --> 00:10:22.540
No, I haven't.

00:10:24.170 --> 00:10:25.540
Really?

00:10:26.460 --> 00:10:28.880
Then you should try calling her!

00:10:30.580 --> 00:10:35.000
It's late now, so she might be asleep,
but you could send her a text message.

00:10:35.920 --> 00:10:36.880
What do you think?

00:10:39.540 --> 00:10:41.040
No, I'd better not.

00:10:41.170 --> 00:10:44.750
I would feel bad if I did anything to interrupt her
when she's having a good time.

